    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Rod, Uncommon (Requires Attunement by a Spellcaster)</em></p><p>This rod is made of intertwined, living plant stems.</p><p><strong>Budding (Uncommon).</strong> Multicolored leaves decorate the rod’s stems, and a few buds cluster near each end.</p><p>While you hold the rod, you can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDruidcraft]{Druidcraft} or @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPlantGrowt]{Plant Growth} (Overgrowth only) from it. Once the rod has been used to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPlantGrowt]{Plant Growth}, it can’t be used to cast this spell again until the next dawn.</p><p>While you hold the rod, as a Magic action, you can rejuvenate nonmagical plants in a 5-foot Cube you can see within 15 feet of yourself. The rejuvenated plants remain verdant for 1d4 days, after which they grow or wither as normal plants would.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-ZFLlUGz4tdKQozAk\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Ce sceptre évolue : chaque version garde les propriétés des précédentes. Quand il évolue, remplacez-le par la version suivante (Budding, puis Flowering, puis Somniferous). Pour <em>Plant Growth</em>, choisissez l’activité <em>Overgrowth</em> du sort.</p></section>",
